    "title": "Solid Waste Detection",
    "description": "A grid-based semantic-segmentation model that classifies 5 m x 5 m UAV-imagery cells as background or waste. The classifier is pretrained on 60 globally distributed OpenAerialMap scenes.",
    "mlm:name": "yolo-swag-waste-grid-segmentation",
